            power.</span
          ></div
        >
        <div
          ><span class="dot"></span><span
            ><strong>Milk supply is protected</strong> by design. Nursing mamas get
            ranges built for two.</span
          ></div
        >
        <div
          ><span class="dot"></span><span
            ><strong>1,200-calorie culture ends here.</strong> We will never hand
            you a starvation plan with a pink bow on it.</span
          ></div
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div
        class="guard-card rv"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Example guardrail message from the app when weight loss is too fast"
